{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>A Pet Sanctuary at the Bottom of Your Screen!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch over your <strong>Cozy\u00a0Sanctuary</strong>, where adorable animals find a peaceful home. While you work or relax, your little companions will play, eat, and grow happier under your care!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574760/extras/7f3c133c11cd177bd7db68a95bef7c75.poster.avif?t=1771951296\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574760/extras/7f3c133c11cd177bd7db68a95bef7c75.webm?t=1771951296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574760/extras/7f3c133c11cd177bd7db68a95bef7c75.mp4?t=1771951296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Care for Your Animals &amp; Farm Their Food</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise a variety of <strong>cute creatures</strong>, keeping them <strong>fed, clean, and happy</strong>. Grow their food in a small <strong>farm</strong>, water crops, and use compost to <strong>speed up growth</strong>. Pick up their mess, pet them for points, and let them enjoy toys and decorations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574760/extras/49ba52cf8b8b496ea2eaff779889fb95.poster.avif?t=1771951296\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574760/extras/49ba52cf8b8b496ea2eaff779889fb95.webm?t=1771951296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574760/extras/49ba52cf8b8b496ea2eaff779889fb95.mp4?t=1771951296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Unlock New Species, Crops &amp; Decorations</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every happy animal brings new surprises! Unlock <strong>new animals, crops, decorations, and facilities</strong> to automate tasks, making your sanctuary <strong>more vibrant and self-sustaining</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574760/extras/9dd8d30f01021707091088b2c21af50c.poster.avif?t=1771951296\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574760/extras/9dd8d30f01021707091088b2c21af50c.webm?t=1771951296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574760/extras/9dd8d30f01021707091088b2c21af50c.mp4?t=1771951296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Build &amp; Expand Your Perfect Haven</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your sanctuary with <strong>benches, lamps, flowers, and more</strong> to create the ultimate cozy space. Upgrade facilities like auto-feeders and petters to keep your animals thriving while you sit back and enjoy the peaceful atmosphere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574760/extras/daef934033fd11f32ab437a0eecb4a80.poster.avif?t=1771951296\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574760/extras/daef934033fd11f32ab437a0eecb4a80.webm?t=1771951296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source sr